>Sheila H. /&/Elwood Blues wrote:
>> 
>> Thank you for playing. but you are out.
>> The last PDP was really the 15.  Some could argue the 16.
>> just to get this nostalgia trip going better:
>> after the 11 was the 12.
>> After the 12 was the 14.
>> after the 14 was the 15.
>> There was something referred to as the 16.
