days) but M$'s BASICs are at best a faint shadow of BASIC-PLUS.  No SYS(),
no CVTxx, no statement modifiers, nothing like EXTEND mode until later when
they Pascalified it (so the newer M$ BASICs aren't really BASIC at all),
file operations are different.  It would be a very involved port.

John Wilson
D Bit



