>I am considering installing NetBSD 1.3 on my DECstation 3100.  I was wondering 
>if anyone had any experience with running NetBSD on the DECstation and could 
>point out any of the pros and cons relating to it.  I am currently running 
>Ultrix 4.4 and have had some difficulty compiling some programs such as perl 5 
