:Is there anyone out there who has the right ModeLines (or timings) for
:this Monitor? I tried the ones for the VR290-DA, but it didn't work.

  This is the first time I've seen Linux as the target operating system,
  but the answer is the same as for any typical (commodity) EISA, ISA, or
  PCI graphics controller under j-random Microsoft OpSys: forget it.

