> goal is here?
> 
> Generally not requiring you to pass packets through the router when on
> the same ethernet is seen as a goodness... but I'd like to hear/read
> any reasons why this is not good.
> 
> If you don't want it to operate this way, don't put the systems on the
> same ethernet (ie., put a router *between* them).
