master for our domain is a Sun Sparc 2 running SunOS 4.1.1.  As a part of
the Sun's YP services, DNS seems to be done "automatically" using our name
servers on campus as specified in the Sun's resolv.conf file.  Thus,
clients have full name service via the Sun.  This doesn't seem to be the
