Michael Soon <mssk@bc.sympatico.ca> wrote:

> Does anyone know how to set the dip switches for the DEC Ethernet Turbo
>A09-DE200 card?  There are 12 dip switches in all. 

from ek-de200-om.003  owners manual

Sw 1-4 mem address range

1	2	3	4

buffer size 64
on	on	on	on	c0000-cffff
on 	off	on	on	d0000-dffff  default
off	on	on	on	e0000-effff

buffer size 32kb	
on	on	off	off	c8000-cffff
on	off	off	off	d8000-dfff
off	on	off	off	e8000-efff

note sw 3&4 select 64 or 32kb buffer 3/4 on = 64kb recomended

sw 5 i/o address on 300-30f = default
		off  200-20f 

sw 6  on  disable remote boot = default
         off enable remote boot

sw 7  on remote boot timeout 150 sec
        off remote boot timeout 30 sec = default

sw 8-12 	irq (select one only = on)

sw 8	irq5   default
     9	irq9
    10	irq10
    11	irq11
    12	irq15

