	A 17" DEC monitor (PCXBV-LA) I've had for about 1 1/2 years has begun to
'act up' lately.  It will not come out of low power mode after being left
inactive for more than an hour or two and if it does come back on the
display is distorted and the monitor will abruptly return back to low-power
mode.   In addition, I cannot adjust the picture with any of the adjustment
controls - the LED's come on when the monitor is powered up but the
adjustment buttons do nothing.  Any suggestions as to what may be causing
this strange behavior?

JAC



